01\" data-start=\"672\">official website of UKPSC</strong> in the <strong data-end=\"739\" data-start=\"709\">\u201cAdmit Card / Latest Updates\u201d</strong> section.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> In what format is the <strong>UKPSC Mains Admit Card available?</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The Admit card is released in a <strong data-end=\"861\" data-start=\"847\">PDF format</strong>, containing the <strong data-end=\"894\" data-start=\"878\">roll numbers</strong> of candidates shortlisted for the Mains Examination.<br/>\n</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Question:</strong> What is the official website of the <strong>UKPSC</strong>?</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 14pt;\"><strong>Answer:</strong> The official website of the <strong>UKPSC</strong> is <strong>https://www.psc.uk.gov.in/</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p>\u00a0</p>\n<p><img alt=\"UKPSC Upper PCS Mains Admit Card 2025 - Out\" class=\"size-full wp-image-33035\" decoding=\"async\" fetchpriority=\"high\" height=\"576\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" src=\"http://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/UKPSC-Upper-PCS-Mains-Admit-Card-2025-Out.jpg\" srcset=\"https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/UKPSC-Upper-PCS-Mains-Admit-Card-2025-Out.jpg 1024w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/UKPSC-Upper-PCS-Mains-Admit-Card-2025-Out-300x169.jpg 300w, https://sarkariresult.com.cm/wp-content/uploads/2026/01/UKPSC-Upper-PCS-Mains-Admit-Card-2025-Out-768x432.jpg 768w\" width=\"1024\"/></p>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"gb-container gb-container-ce6e23c9\">\n<p class=\"gb-headline gb-headline-a1cd0fe1\"><span class=\"gb-headline-text\">Sarkari Result.Com.Cm</span></p>\n<p class=